  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If the variance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> of the data <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnlines=\"solid\" frame=\"solid\" rowlines=\"solid\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>10</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>12</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>17</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math> then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>k</mi></mfenced></math> is ______ {where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mo>.</mo></mfenced></math> denotes the greatest integer funciton}</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "29",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Finding the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><mo> </mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo> </mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></msup></math> we get, </p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/65fd7a2b-8492-4636-abe9-d668833434e9.png\" style=\"width: 512px; height: 338px;\"/></p><p>Now, from above table we get, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>176</mn></math></p><p>Now, finding  <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>176</mn><mn>22</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p>Now, finding variance, we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mfrac><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><mmultiscripts><mo>-</mo><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>2</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>(</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>22</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>2048</mn><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo> </mo><mn>93</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>090964</mn><mo> </mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo> </mo><mn>29</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0909</mn><mo> </mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo> </mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>29</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0909</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>29</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
